{"product_id":"shatter-me","title":"Shatter Me","description":"\u003cp\u003eI have a curse. I have a gift. I'm a monster. I'm more than human. My touch is lethal. My touch is power. I am their weapon. I will fight back. No one knows why Juliette's touch is fatal, but The Reestablishment has plans for her. Plans to use her as a weapon. But Juliette has plans of her own. After a lifetime without freedom, she's finally discovering a strength to fight back for the very first time—and to find a future with the one boy she thought she'd lost forever. In this electrifying debut, Tahereh Mafi presents a riveting dystopian world, a thrilling superhero story, and an unforgettable heroine.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tahereh Mafi\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780062085504\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 338\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 135 x 203\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Bookhero.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41761730658457,"sku":"8RC9780062085504","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/shatter-me-139318.jpg?v=1694791407","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/shatter-me","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}